{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddc9dbfa2c20773a2fce0303ea186ea50310072402d53c93657ccb4ccdb6897",
      "text": "疾驰的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a399aad206efa1a00e498c6ba2e344f78b6731f3eacb60c256c6140e72e7032f",
      "text": "确定起用神速一魂出演朱雀爱读的摩托车杂志CM，\n并在活动舞台上登台。两人干劲十足地迎战活动。\n以二人一宠展现的热血舞台为契机，\n随后又接到了全新工作的洽询……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddc9dbfa2c20773a2fce0303ea186ea50310072402d53c93657ccb4ccdb6897",
      "text": "疾驰的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71912fc0ff82f53245097aa103e67278a259c5429fbe6a8f4e2162b6d3493713",
      "text": "幸好买到这个月的啦！\n重型机车特辑，我可是超级期待的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d7d7e142ca3ccb7cd6ae2b4e3e87c90e798d8f95d31a9730da75bd06383fab",
      "text": "封面的摩托也太酷了，真想快点看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ece7d248e94e4e97263f8beb5c3a0afe9b0f06bb5a60d6d075ba72a6171f12",
      "text": "我也想骑啊，但还没驾照……\n还得说服老爹他们才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f2160db22c618bfbf2989392b94d4f46e2a9a6c55185543f522e09c20842ed",
      "text": "真想什么时候跟玄武一起骑车兜风啊。\n到时候，一定要骑超拉风的摩托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17ee4f78a2a4fdb5bf5c8b05cd961ab309c9358bcd64e0d8b8a9738ca861979",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ec56400a9e748e6ed43948ba60dbdbd9ea684474599958c0cb9366d4b8d03f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，当然你也一起啦！\n不对，哇啊！都这个时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:298bc1957f7ce720428effbde4a5d72927ffb113d84005e608cbc4074d6f1f31",
      "text": "得去事务所了，不然碰头会要迟到了！\n喵子，要是哪天能接到摩托车的工作就好了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000077:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67df782466d2eab07334d1f2058cd01fdf8390f89ed57754d6b276d0ac68bff8",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，辛苦了。\n那么，今天要谈什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83f176e2ad309309448bcf9bb5f09961984d717bb7d3ff1d6e58674ebce795e",
      "text": "是的，有给神速一魂的邀约。\n这次是摩托车杂志的工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3afbf1a44a8573f453b7b8b4d017c58ef6eea3b390c20f35ab223e20ba10dff4",
      "text": "什、什么——！！？？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
